WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.302
-Thanks to newly developed
technology,

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:04.070
we here at "Late Night"
have the ability

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:08.341
to record the tiny voice that's
inside Donald Trump's head.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:09.541
And you might
be surprised to know

00:00:09.541 --> 00:00:11.043
that like
everyone's inner voice,

00:00:11.043 --> 00:00:14.080
Donald Trump's is filled with
paralyzing fear and self-doubt.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.116
So here it is, the tiny voice

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:18.217
in the back
of Donald Trump's head.

00:00:18.217 --> 00:00:22.688 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:25.057
-In my capacity as...

00:00:25.057 --> 00:00:26.292
-Hey, Donald.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:28.527
It's me, the tiny voice
in the back of your head.

00:00:28.527 --> 00:00:29.963
Are you thinking
what I'm thinking?

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:32.165
Because I'm thinking
that Mike Pence

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:35.001
looks a lot more
like a president than you do.

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:36.669
I mean, look at him.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:40.974
He's killing it right now,
speaking in complete sentences,

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:44.344
turning the page
each time he finishes a page,

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:45.978
not making insane gestures.

00:00:45.978 --> 00:00:48.181
He looks like a real president.

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:49.215
And look at you.

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:50.883
You look like a guy
who won a contest

00:00:50.883 --> 00:00:53.152
to stand next to a president.

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:55.254
I mean,
he's a complete freak and all,

00:00:55.254 --> 00:00:57.957
but at least he can
fake being normal.

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:02.295
How does it feel
to be weirder than Mike Pence?

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:05.065 line:0%
♪♪

